Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.47,0:00:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Soo-hyun - Kim Ji-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.95,0:00:26.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Park Sung-hoon - Kwak Dong-yeon - Lee Joo-bin{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.55,0:00:33.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Gab-soo - Lee Mi-sook{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.63,0:00:35.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jung Jin-young - Na Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.66,0:00:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jeon Bae-soo - Hwang Young-hee{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.68,0:00:39.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Kim Jung-nan - Kim Joo-ryoung{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.73,0:00:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Jang Yoon-ju - Kim Do-hyun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.13,0:00:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Screenwriter: Park Ji-eun{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.00,0:00:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Directors: Jang Young-woo - Kim Hee-won{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.14,0:01:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.56,0:01:04.27,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Episode 6{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.82,0:01:57.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Hae-in suddenly go to Germany?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.95,0:02:01.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Beats me. She just said it was a private matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.18,0:02:28.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.81,0:02:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't smoke, since there\Nare cameras everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.86,0:02:34.38,Default,,0,0,0,,All the cameras are off,\Nand the helpers are gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.40,0:02:38.10,Default,,0,0,0,,This is my only chance. Let\Nme smoke one and have a glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.95,0:02:41.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's do that next time, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.24,0:02:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Take your time. The night is young.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.00,0:02:52.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in is gone, and Hyun-woo left too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.74,0:03:27.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It may seem they don't get along,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.08,0:03:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but I beg to differ.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.71,0:03:37.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}They like each other,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.75,0:03:39.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}but they don't know that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.09,0:03:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's why they're never\Non the same page. Fools.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.88,0:04:17.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Hong Hae-in!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.75,0:04:21.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Dream on if your plan is to find\Nsomething on Hyun-woo and kick him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.42,0:04:24.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Grace has been watching him for three years,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.18,0:04:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and has found nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.22,0:04:28.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- Really?\N- I'm telling you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.19,0:04:41.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But someone who's clean\Nwouldn't have something like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.66,0:04:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Kim, why are you calling me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.83,0:04:55.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}We shouldn't call each other\Nwhen our bosses are on vacation.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.06,0:04:56.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you? Jeju Island?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.26,0:04:57.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Somewhere better.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.33,0:04:59.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the point. I'll hang up if you talk shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.75,0:05:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Is Ms. Hong in Frankfurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.13,0:05:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I think Mr. Baek flew out yesterday,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.59,0:05:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,but he didn't tell me his destination.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.59,0:05:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,How would I know where your boss went?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.85,0:05:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did Ms. Hong go to Germany?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.47,0:05:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are you curious?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.64,0:05:15.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They both suddenly left,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.81,0:05:17.75,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and I'm in the dark.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.77,0:05:20.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't bother looking for\Nthem if they don't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.90,0:05:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.94,0:05:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Plus, I haven't had a week-long break in years,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.49,0:05:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,so don't call me for trivial\Nor important matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.04,0:05:34.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.66,0:05:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.50,0:05:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Where in the world are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.55,0:05:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.60,0:05:54.13,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought I'd find it here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.35,0:05:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,A miraculous way to live,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.02,0:06:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,or a place of no sadness.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.57,0:06:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,But there was none.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.32,0:06:10.06,Default,,0,0,0,,All I wanted...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.99,0:06:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,was to go home with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.72,0:07:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You two must be madly in love,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.64,0:07:18.16,Default,,0,0,0,,but do you think you can do that somewhere else?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.18,0:07:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,My lovely wife is also waiting for me...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.15,0:07:27.35,Default,,0,0,0,,back home.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.47,0:08:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder what secret he's hiding.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.10,0:08:01.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It might be nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.39,0:08:02.62,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.64,0:08:04.91,Default,,0,0,0,,A relationship is bound\Nto crumble with a secret.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.94,0:08:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the power of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.53,0:08:20.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why cup noodles so suddenly?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.75,0:08:25.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to give it a try.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.88,0:08:28.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's full of chemicals and MSG,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.59,0:08:32.37,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'd be upset if I died\Nwithout having a taste.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.59,0:08:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Just wait three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.05,0:08:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll talk in the meantime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.76,0:08:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll talk while we wait, so it won't seem...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.68,0:08:44.22,Default,,0,0,0,,too serious.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.39,0:08:45.37,Default,,0,0,0,,About what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.39,0:08:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Things I'd like you to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.86,0:08:51.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm listening.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.61,0:08:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't hold...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.65,0:08:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,memorial services for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.24,0:08:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't like any of the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.78,0:09:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to commemorate me,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.95,0:09:04.89,Default,,0,0,0,,just think of me while having\Nsome wine at a nice place,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.91,0:09:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,and place a few Hercyna handbags on the table.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.42,0:09:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you being like this\Nbecause the clinic rejected you?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.34,0:09:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,They could call you back\Nwith good news down the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.30,0:09:18.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Write up a nice obituary too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.14,0:09:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Add some moving stories about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.10,0:09:23.53,Default,,0,0,0,,There are none.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.56,0:09:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I'm sure there are some.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.98,0:09:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Also...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.63,0:09:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,There's more?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.65,0:09:31.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay alert at my funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.15,0:09:33.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone who disliked me will attend.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.99,0:09:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyeon-ju, Jeong-mi, Eun-jin, and Ye-na.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.99,0:09:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen carefully...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.66,0:09:40.41,Default,,0,0,0,,to what they say.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.43,0:09:41.43,Default,,0,0,0,,And?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.45,0:09:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Sue them all if they bad-mouth me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.12,0:09:46.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Sue them for defaming the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.83,0:09:48.39,Default,,0,0,0,,- Me?\N- Then should I?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.42,0:09:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'll be in the coffin.\N- Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:57.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think anyone would mourn,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.68,0:10:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,so you should.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.43,0:10:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll cry, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.35,0:10:08.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Cry when there are many people.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.39,0:10:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's better if there are cameras around.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.73,0:10:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.86,0:10:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,to cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.45,0:10:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes and no.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.28,0:10:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I want you to feel sad,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.70,0:10:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't want you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.58,0:10:30.57,Default,,0,0,0,,to be too sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.29,0:10:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd feel uneasy if you remembered me forever,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.00,0:10:38.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but I'd be enraged if you moved on quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.97,0:10:40.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Then what should I do?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.93,0:10:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.18,0:10:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,like you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.64,0:10:49.63,Default,,0,0,0,,to think it's a shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.65,0:10:55.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like you to pity...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.28,0:10:58.31,Default,,0,0,0,,that I'm no longer around.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.82,0:11:02.36,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.83,0:11:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Your three minutes are up.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.54,0:11:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Last one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.76,0:11:21.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a will.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.51,0:11:24.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I wrote it before we married.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.60,0:11:28.55,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom refused to give us her\Nblessing if I didn't write one.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.14,0:11:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't inherit anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.10,0:11:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what it says, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.77,0:11:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to revise it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.52,0:11:38.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know this day would come so soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.36,0:11:43.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I just wrote it so we could get married.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.83,0:11:47.98,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.74,0:11:50.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you upset?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.08,0:11:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.33,0:11:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm thankful...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.80,0:11:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,that you'd do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.92,0:12:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Please do that,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.97,0:12:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.97,0:12:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,not right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.31,0:12:10.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.81,0:12:13.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then when?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.19,0:12:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.65,0:12:20.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Once you're fully recovered,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.11,0:12:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,you can do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.57,0:12:28.28,Default,,0,0,0,,But for now...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.83,0:12:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.00,0:12:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been over three minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.26,0:12:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll get soggy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.50,0:13:16.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Juseong Tech 24{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.59,0:13:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Put that back. We need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.22,0:13:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't buy this, even\Nafter waiting for months.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.72,0:13:36.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But she has it stashed in her closet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.69,0:13:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, how would things have turned\Nout if we'd been rich like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.32,0:13:44.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Would our lives have been different?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.57,0:13:46.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you envious?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I would've been smarter than Soo-cheol.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.33,0:13:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he so dumb?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.58,0:13:56.91,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never met anyone who\Nwas easier to fool than him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.67,0:13:59.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you could marry him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.96,0:14:03.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what he said to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.76,0:14:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I don't like Lee Seung-gi, despite his fame.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.00,0:14:11.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Why?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.01,0:14:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}He sang about a woman older than him.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.85,0:14:17.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I don't like women who are older than me.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.43,0:14:19.79,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}My sisters bullied me ever since I was little,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.81,0:14:22.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}so I'm traumatized.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.02,0:14:23.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I see.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.19,0:14:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}My body reacts first when I meet an older woman.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.48,0:14:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I get goosebumps and rashes.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.40,0:14:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Even I am fascinated by myself.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.53,0:14:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I'm like an age detector.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.74,0:14:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you think he'd react...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.54,0:14:40.95,Default,,0,0,0,,if he finds out his wife is\Nactually five years older than him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.84,0:14:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.85,0:14:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't touch the head with\Niron. Bring me the bamboo knife.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.76,0:14:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.43,0:14:58.83,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.85,0:15:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,This? It's wild ginseng.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.60,0:15:04.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just any wild\Nginseng. It's a century old.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.40,0:15:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This gift from God can even\Nbring the dead back to life.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.69,0:15:09.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.65,0:15:11.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Figuratively speaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.53,0:15:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Soo-cheol's anxiety and excessive\Nsweating are due to his weak energy,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.95,0:15:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,so he needs to eat this regularly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.83,0:15:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,The entire length of\Nthis wild ginseng is 4 feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.12,0:15:26.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had wild ginseng for 20 years now,\Nbut I've never seen one this big before.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.80,0:15:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, give this to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.42,0:15:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be silly.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.92,0:15:31.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you like wild ginseng?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.34,0:15:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Seon-hwa, how much was this? I'll pay you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.35,0:15:38.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I bought this for no one else but my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.35,0:15:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.06,0:15:42.33,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.35,0:15:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's for your other child, Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.27,0:15:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Why would you,\Nwhen she's already so strong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.82,0:15:49.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want her to become Superwoman?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.78,0:15:52.81,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.11,0:15:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,She could get sick, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.58,0:16:01.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in has rarely caught a cold in\Nher lifetime, so don't worry about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.73,0:16:02.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Seon-hwa.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.79,0:16:07.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You can never guarantee one's health.\NIt doesn't mean she'll be healthy forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.80,0:16:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me take care of my children's health.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.84,0:16:18.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, you said this was 4 feet long.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.68,0:16:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you split it with Hae-in?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.68,0:16:23.75,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not that I don't want to share.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.77,0:16:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Wild ginseng is only\Neffective if you have it whole.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.27,0:16:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, then let Hae-in have it all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.32,0:16:33.05,Default,,0,0,0,,You haven't said anything for\Nthe past 20 years, so why now?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.07,0:16:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being greedy if you've\Nhad it for that long, you scumbag!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.25,0:16:43.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness. What's the matter with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.41,0:16:45.53,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's menopause.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.92,0:16:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, eat it before she comes back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.79,0:16:49.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.38,0:16:52.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- Please chop it into thirds.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.18,0:17:01.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-jun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.47,0:17:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, Beom-ja.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.77,0:17:07.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-seok left for Hawaii last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.98,0:17:12.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We never got together.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.90,0:17:16.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.28,0:17:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.08,0:17:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you feeding the snail right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.08,0:17:26.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Paengsun's shell broke.\NShe must be in so much pain.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.92,0:17:29.89,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs to eat eggshells for more calcium,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.92,0:17:33.29,Default,,0,0,0,,but she just won't eat any.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.76,0:17:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it to you if that snail\Nbroke its shell and has no appetite?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.68,0:17:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,There you go again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.14,0:17:43.07,Default,,0,0,0,,When a snail loses its shell...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.10,0:17:46.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care! It'll probably turn into a slug!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.89,0:17:49.97,Default,,0,0,0,,She'll die without her shell.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.31,0:17:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Simply put, she's suffering\Nfrom an incurable illness.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.15,0:17:54.85,Default,,0,0,0,,She's terminally ill.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.62,0:18:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's wrong?\N- Beom-jun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.34,0:18:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.26,0:18:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is it this time?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.09,0:18:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My poor Beom-jun...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.89,0:18:21.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-ja.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.14,0:18:24.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry to say this,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.85,0:18:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but you're our most pitiful\Nfamily member after Paengsun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.69,0:18:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-jun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.40,0:18:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Have a glass.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.54,0:18:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just dying to drink, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.51,0:19:01.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What should I do with my poor brother?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.37,0:19:26.99,Default,,0,0,0,,They're all in German.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.79,0:19:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,We're in Germany, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.00,0:19:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Should I turn it off?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.35,0:19:47.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll sleep in that room.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.52,0:19:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You can sleep wherever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.23,0:19:56.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you want me to take that room?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:03.76,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not what I said.\NJust sleep wherever you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.78,0:20:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as you want. Follow your heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.89,0:20:29.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.97,0:20:31.97,Default,,0,0,0,,May I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.18,0:20:34.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, starting today,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.06,0:20:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,may I sleep in your room?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.36,0:20:46.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:48.52,Default,,0,0,0,,you're still uncomfortable.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.45,0:20:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I never said that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.96,0:20:56.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.13,0:21:00.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't jump to conclusions. I'm...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.13,0:21:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,thinking about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.46,0:21:04.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.47,0:21:07.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.47,0:21:09.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.68,0:21:14.04,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.39,0:21:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,just today,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.27,0:21:18.04,Default,,0,0,0,,or starting today?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.06,0:21:20.33,Default,,0,0,0,,From this day until forever?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.36,0:21:23.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this day until forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.24,0:21:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.70,0:21:36.41,Default,,0,0,0,,- Deal.\N- I see. "Deal"?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.92,0:21:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,That's what you said, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.05,0:21:43.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.32,0:22:08.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know Kim Ye-na?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.20,0:22:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The CEO of Royal, who we\Nmet at the Hercyna party.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.37,0:22:13.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.33,0:22:14.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She got...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.83,0:22:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,into a car accident last week.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.83,0:22:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,She fainted and went to the ED.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.67,0:22:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Then her husband and her attorney rushed over.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:24.46,0:22:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,- Her attorney?\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.34,0:22:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Her husband thought she was dying,\Nso he wanted her to sign a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.47,0:22:33.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.47,0:22:41.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He desperately told the\Ndoctor she couldn't die just yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.52,0:22:43.37,Default,,0,0,0,,because she had to sign something.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.40,0:22:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,He caused a scene and said\Nshe had to revise her will.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.40,0:22:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,He was so noisy that she woke up.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.07,0:22:52.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.91,0:22:55.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw it coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.87,0:22:58.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He looks like a human version of Shrek.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.50,0:23:00.60,Default,,0,0,0,,How could that monster be so heinous?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.62,0:23:04.54,Default,,0,0,0,,His wife is on the brink of death,\Nand he only cares for her money?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.13,0:23:06.95,Default,,0,0,0,,He deserves to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.88,0:23:13.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't talk so harshly.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.26,0:23:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. It's not just him.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.64,0:23:20.24,Default,,0,0,0,,The first thing people ask when\Nthey hear about someone's death is,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.27,0:23:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"So who's receiving all the inheritance?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.23,0:23:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,"The cash? Real estate?\NStocks? Inheritance tax?"
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.23,0:23:29.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Some even say there are\Nhusbands who laugh in the toilet...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.24,0:23:31.23,Default,,0,0,0,,at their wife's funeral.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.74,0:23:39.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Not everyone...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.75,0:23:45.66,Default,,0,0,0,,is like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.25,0:23:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.21,0:23:53.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you remember the first thing\Nyou said when I said I was sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.29,0:23:57.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I love you, Hong Hae-in.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:57.88,0:23:58.85,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I love you.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.88,0:24:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,"I love you."
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.19,0:24:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.19,0:24:08.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you know those words comforted me so much?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.44,0:24:11.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.28,0:24:14.09,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't put too much emphasis on what I said...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.11,0:24:17.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted to see if I was breathing well.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.33,0:24:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You panicked when I coughed.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.91,0:24:24.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Are you okay? Please call the ambulance.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.17,0:24:28.44,Default,,0,0,0,,You didn't care about my\Nwill or the fortune you'd get.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.46,0:24:30.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You never asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.71,0:24:34.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You stayed up all night worrying about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.26,0:24:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,That's my husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:41.56,0:24:43.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're one of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:46.73,0:24:48.43,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.57,0:24:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no one like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.23,0:24:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And now you flew across the world just for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.99,0:24:59.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It was only possible...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.08,0:25:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to the direct flight.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.91,0:25:05.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm truly blessed with a good husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.92,0:25:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:11.96,0:25:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,That's one thing you don't have.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.59,0:27:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo, where are you?\NYou haven't been picking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.74,0:27:18.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I can't go.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.80,0:27:21.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}I should've told you, but I was too busy.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.43,0:27:23.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.43,0:27:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't say right now. Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.26,0:27:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Just answer me "yes" or "no."\NAre you being held against your will?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.93,0:27:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you saying? No, I'm not.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.02,0:27:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Then why can't you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.69,0:27:35.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheol-seung told his wife she couldn't come,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.02,0:27:37.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and she hit him with a\Nslipper, but he still came.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.82,0:27:39.43,Default,,0,0,0,,- She hit my head.\N- So where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.45,0:27:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We're having a blast.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.80,0:27:41.84,Default,,0,0,0,,- Dae-ho...\N- {\i1}I know.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.86,0:27:44.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He probably brought crates\Nfull of soju and beer.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.91,0:27:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Yeong-beom and Sang-pil\Nare probably lighting the wood,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:47.62,0:27:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're holding a pair of tongs.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.29,0:27:50.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Who bought this meat?\N- Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.62,0:27:54.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheol-seung probably bought pork shoulder,\Nsince it's chewier than pork belly.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:54.92,0:27:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,We even have pork neck. It's juicy and soft.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.55,0:28:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, there's juicy pork neck,\Nchewy pork shoulder,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.42,0:28:04.15,Default,,0,0,0,,beer, and soju,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.18,0:28:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,but we wouldn't have\Nfinished them if I was there.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.55,0:28:09.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I would've ruined the mood.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.31,0:28:10.84,Default,,0,0,0,,So where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.23,0:28:19.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.19,0:28:22.05,Default,,0,0,0,,So you ended up going.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.07,0:28:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}You'd better not regret it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.36,0:28:26.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're going to dip some grilled\Npork neck in {\i1}gochujang,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.87,0:28:28.09,Default,,0,0,0,,and mix some alcohol too.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.12,0:28:30.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay, have fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.70,0:28:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in and I will have beer and {\i1}schweinshaxe.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.54,0:28:36.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hey, what's "schweinshaxe"?\N- Isn't that German pig feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.71,0:28:38.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't care. You'll pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.67,0:28:41.15,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not returning your entry fee.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.17,0:28:42.15,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.17,0:28:43.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo can't come.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.34,0:28:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did he get caught?\N- Did he?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.63,0:28:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.64,0:28:51.17,Default,,0,0,0,,He's changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.14,0:28:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,He's totally changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.07,0:29:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Honey, look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.28,0:29:07.44,Default,,0,0,0,,The lab reached out.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.07,0:31:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,There's this treatment\Ncalled the "Filgrastim shot."
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.65,0:31:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,They want to raise my WBC with that,\Neven though it's not guaranteed.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.41,0:31:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,They still want to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.30,0:31:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, that's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.26,0:31:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,See? I told you there'd be good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.68,0:31:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.76,0:31:37.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Maintaining a good immune system\Nis crucial for this treatment.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:37.68,0:31:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Maintain a good body temperature,\Nso you won't catch a cold.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.32,0:31:42.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure you have protein, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.60,0:31:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and stay away from raw foods\Nin case of blood poisoning.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.52,0:31:47.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.28,0:31:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,How do you know these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.86,0:31:53.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's common sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.95,0:31:55.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Since when?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.60,0:32:18.57,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Juseong Tech 24{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.40,0:32:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello. How may I help you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:31.44,0:32:33.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you do need to help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:33.95,0:32:35.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:43.79,0:32:44.85,Default,,0,0,0,,How was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.87,0:32:46.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- It was great.\N- I'm glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.71,0:32:49.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.22,0:33:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay alert, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.43,0:33:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's wrong?\N- "What's wrong"?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.69,0:33:05.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.35,0:33:06.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at this.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.35,0:33:09.01,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the dashcam footage.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:10.32,0:33:11.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Why am I...?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.32,0:33:13.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, you idiot. You could've been caught.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.90,0:33:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do I look so fat?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.74,0:33:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that important?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.07,0:33:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Why were you standing there\Nwhen there were cars driving around?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.29,0:33:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,- Is it my fault?\N- Then is it mine?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.83,0:33:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Aren't we on the same team?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.25,0:33:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You should support me,\Nso I can do well out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.50,0:33:29.56,Default,,0,0,0,,but what is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.59,0:33:33.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I did all the work and was almost\Ncaught, thanks to your incompetence.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.57,0:33:34.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.59,0:33:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What if Mr. Yoon hadn't found this?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.68,0:33:39.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay alert.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.89,0:33:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,We're almost there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.85,0:33:44.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Almost where?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.31,0:33:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Will Eun-sung bring the big shots...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:47.15,0:33:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,and swallow Queens whole?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.61,0:33:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,It's none of your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:51.23,0:33:53.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Just take your share and leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.53,0:33:55.35,Default,,0,0,0,,That's true,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.82,0:33:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,but what'll happen to the family\Nonce he takes over Queens?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.70,0:34:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me you're worried about Soo-cheol?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.16,0:34:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.16,0:34:07.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:07.50,0:34:09.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That was insulting.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.42,0:34:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think I have feelings for that idiot?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.63,0:34:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.67,0:34:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget. You're not a rich madam\Njust because people treat you like one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.51,0:34:19.61,Default,,0,0,0,,Whatever. I don't even want to become one.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.64,0:34:21.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't even smoke in peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:21.89,0:34:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Right. Quit smoking, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:24.35,0:34:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I had to learn how to edit\Nvideos, so I could erase...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:26.98,0:34:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,footage of you smoking in the garden!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.56,0:34:33.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That's great. Become a YouTuber once you retire.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.15,0:34:36.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.36,0:34:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.62,0:34:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, ma'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.53,0:34:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,When did you arrive?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.62,0:34:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Who were you shouting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:47.66,0:34:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry? Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:49.04,0:34:50.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It was your voice.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.75,0:34:52.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't say anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.09,0:34:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma'am, did you hear something?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:55.55,0:34:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't hear anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.63,0:35:02.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother, you're scaring me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.39,0:35:08.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a headache, since\NI couldn't sleep last night.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:08.43,0:35:09.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, dear.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:09.98,0:35:12.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You need a scalp massage.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:12.27,0:35:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You should dip your body\Nin some pink salt first.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.36,0:35:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,After you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.71,0:35:34.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the best masseuse ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.21,0:35:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I already feel much better.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.47,0:35:42.17,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.47,0:35:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard Mr. Baek went to Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.64,0:35:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.18,0:35:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.18,0:35:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.48,0:35:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.85,0:35:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.06,0:35:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,To be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:57.02,0:35:59.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I made a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.28,0:36:02.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What mistake?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.91,0:36:06.47,Default,,0,0,0,,A few days ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.49,0:36:08.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I accidentally told Mr. Baek\Nabout Ms. Hong's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.95,0:36:10.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.50,0:36:15.29,Default,,0,0,0,,He said he heard everything\Nand demanded me to tell the truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.32,0:36:16.31,Default,,0,0,0,,So?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.34,0:36:19.87,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew he'd eventually find\Nout, so I told him roughly.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.51,0:36:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,And he's been causing issues at work ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.97,0:36:25.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.47,0:36:28.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Mr. Hong is doing his utmost best...
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.81,0:36:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,to carry out an investment\Nproject with Mr. Yoon,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:31.73,0:36:35.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but Mr. Baek said they had\Nto get a validity test first,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:35.23,0:36:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,so the project is at risk of being canceled.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:39.86,0:36:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.90,0:36:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on a time crunch, Grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.95,0:36:46.09,Default,,0,0,0,,What if Mr. Yoon changes his mind?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:46.12,0:36:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,So? Business is about being tenacious.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.28,0:36:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't be anxious.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:49.83,0:36:52.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on. We're not the ones investing.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:52.41,0:36:57.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the investor here,\Nso why are we being calculating?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:57.63,0:36:59.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so frustrated.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.25,0:37:00.69,Default,,0,0,0,,We should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.71,0:37:03.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think his money is free, you fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.09,0:37:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo is careful and meticulous, if anything,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:06.84,0:37:08.50,Default,,0,0,0,,so do as he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.06,0:37:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo is so annoying.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:21.82,0:37:23.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Chairman Hong.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.24,0:37:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}The scholarship ceremony will soon begin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:25.32,0:37:28.23,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Soo-cheol, play with your friends.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:29.66,0:37:31.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}This way.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:32.41,0:37:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}But they're not my friends.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.85,0:37:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hey, how dare you throw\Na ball at my brother's head?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:57.77,0:37:59.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}He's already dumb as it is.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.44,0:38:01.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}What if he becomes even dumber?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.69,0:38:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}What's your name?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.03,0:38:04.60,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hong Hae-in. Why?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:08.49,0:38:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}What's his deal?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.99,0:38:13.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Stop crying.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.16,0:38:15.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}You're so noisy.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.17,0:38:27.71,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hey.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.30,0:38:29.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Yes?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:29.30,0:38:30.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Are you the chairman's grandson?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:30.76,0:38:32.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Yes.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.64,0:38:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}And is she your older sister?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.22,0:38:36.09,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Yes.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.73,0:38:38.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Are you the only son?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.60,0:38:40.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I used to have an older brother,{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.56,0:38:42.31,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}but not anymore.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:43.32,0:38:46.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}I see... So you're the only son.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.86,0:38:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Blow into it.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.44,0:38:54.39,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Let's get married later.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.41,0:38:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- No.\N- Why not?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.20,0:38:58.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}You little...!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:00.12,0:39:02.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Grandfather!{\c}{\i0}\N- Grandfather!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.50,0:39:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't only listen to him. Hear me out too. I...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:07.55,0:39:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought long and hard before bringing this up,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.05,0:39:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- so why would you...?\N- What an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.40,0:39:25.92,Default,,0,0,0,,By the way, how is Geon-u...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:25.94,0:39:27.85,Default,,0,0,0,,so handsome?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.90,0:39:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:28.90,0:39:30.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He doesn't take after you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.78,0:39:33.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? We're practically twins.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.62,0:39:37.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he take a DNA test?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.91,0:39:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, as soon as he was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.79,0:39:41.56,Default,,0,0,0,,You saw the result.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.58,0:39:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,They're 99.99% a match.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.38,0:39:45.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't see Da-hye here?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:45.42,0:39:47.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the DNA test is a formality.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:47.76,0:39:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You all took one.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:49.55,0:39:51.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be rude to your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.55,0:39:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I was only joking, since\NGeon-u is so handsome and smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.39,0:39:58.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I can put up with people...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:59.10,0:40:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,bad-mouthing my parents,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.60,0:40:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,but not my wife or son.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.15,0:40:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't think I can eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:06.52,0:40:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Honey.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.82,0:40:13.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrible son.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.49,0:40:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he can put up well with\Npeople bad-mouthing his parents.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.21,0:40:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at his eyebrows.\NI had the same ones as a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.88,0:40:26.95,Default,,0,0,0,,They thickened with time,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.17,0:40:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,and look at his nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.63,0:40:30.61,Default,,0,0,0,,I hit my nose while playing soccer,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.63,0:40:31.98,Default,,0,0,0,,so it's a bit low,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.01,0:40:33.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but I had the same nose.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.26,0:40:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,My nose bridge was so high.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.51,0:40:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,- People thought I was mixed.\N- I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:38.10,0:40:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,His thick hair and his toes...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.56,0:40:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I feel bad for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:43.19,0:40:47.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Our family must have strong\Ngenes. He doesn't resemble you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.07,0:40:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.74,0:41:00.35,Default,,0,0,0,,- Why?\N- I'm the weakest one in the family.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:00.37,0:41:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My sister bosses me around, and my\Ngrandfather scolds me all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:05.08,0:41:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's why you're being mistreated.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:08.09,0:41:09.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do better,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:09.25,0:41:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,so no one will dare mistreat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:15.84,0:41:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,The resort complex project will be\Na hit. I'll do my best for your sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.81,0:41:22.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:26.06,0:41:27.29,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit undercooked.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:27.31,0:41:30.50,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll cook more as we eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:30.52,0:41:33.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, sir. May I ask you for directions?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:36.32,0:41:39.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, you found the right guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:39.83,0:41:43.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I know all the paved and\Nunpaved roads around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.54,0:41:45.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I know where the dogs go,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.50,0:41:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,and even where the birds fly. I know everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.71,0:41:50.56,Default,,0,0,0,,- so ask me.\N- Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:50.59,0:41:52.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a place that was on YouTube.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.34,0:41:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,- Do you know where it is?\N- YouTube?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:55.38,0:41:58.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Was our village on YouTube?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:00.30,0:42:01.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Which area was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:01.97,0:42:03.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- Here.\N- Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:09.65,0:42:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}This must be it.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:11.11,0:42:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't Hong Hae-in sit here?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:13.07,0:42:14.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Hong Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.86,0:42:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You look pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:18.45,0:42:21.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they all doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:21.08,0:42:24.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where Hae-in sat.\NA conglomerate heiress' seat,
Dialogue: 0,0:42:24.45,0:42:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and that's the wall she leaned on.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:27.16,0:42:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like posing in front of the Berlin Wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:29.71,0:42:31.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:31.09,0:42:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:33.17,0:42:36.79,Default,,0,0,0,,They're copying what\NHae-in did in her free time.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.34,0:42:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that the dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:40.34,0:42:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hae-in, please say something.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.97,0:42:46.13,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Hello. I'm Hong Hae-in of Queens Group.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.06,0:42:48.62,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the best leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:48.64,0:42:50.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this the dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.09,0:42:51.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:51.15,0:42:52.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We were right.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.44,0:42:53.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Smile.
Dialogue: 0,0:42:53.46,0:42:56.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}Father, Yongdu-ri has become famous.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.95,0:42:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Hong Hae-in visited{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.41,0:43:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Hong Hae-in was here{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.08,0:43:10.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in was here.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.83,0:43:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Why won't they let us in?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:12.63,0:43:14.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in took one bite of their duck.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:14.67,0:43:17.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Now people line up to eat here...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.21,0:43:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,in the early morning, but still can't get in.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:21.14,0:43:23.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Both the marinated-crab and\Nfrozen-pork-belly restaurants...
Dialogue: 0,0:43:23.93,0:43:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,are fully booked and delivering everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.31,0:43:27.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:27.81,0:43:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they doing this?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.35,0:43:31.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Well... They may be unable\Nto dress like the rich,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.55,0:43:33.75,Default,,0,0,0,,so they want to at least eat like them.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:33.77,0:43:36.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it's something like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:37.07,0:43:38.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in is the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:38.32,0:43:44.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I strived for decades to make Yongdu-ri known,
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.78,0:43:47.93,Default,,0,0,0,,but she achieved that in less than a day.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.95,0:43:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,It's safe to say you have\Nthe upper hand in the election.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:52.00,0:43:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Your daughter-in-law is helping our economy.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.75,0:43:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What's Seok-hun up to?
Dialogue: 0,0:43:58.59,0:44:00.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll bet he feels defeated.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:00.84,0:44:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he wishes Hae-in would\Nvisit his mother's restaurant.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:10.89,0:44:12.59,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:13.56,0:44:16.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Chew slowly, or you'll have an upset stomach.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.23,0:44:18.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Apples are best for indigestion.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.03,0:44:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:23.70,0:44:26.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Why would she eat that?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.08,0:44:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,She should've had pears instead,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:30.12,0:44:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,so why apples?
Dialogue: 0,0:44:32.71,0:44:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Seok-hun, that sly scumbag.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.75,0:44:38.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Yongdu-ri has become\Nhome to apples to outsiders,
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.50,0:44:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,just because Hae-in took a bite.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.76,0:44:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it's "game over."
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.09,0:44:46.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Yongdu-ri Equals Delicious Apples{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:46.55,0:44:48.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.22,0:44:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finally busy now.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:51.23,0:44:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,What a great day.
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.15,0:44:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Take the entire box.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.28,0:45:02.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- The video is trending.\N- Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.82,0:45:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's reached over 500,000 views.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.82,0:45:08.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Mi-seon, I became a fan\Nof Ms. Hong after her visit.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.78,0:45:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How was there a halo around her...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.25,0:45:14.18,Default,,0,0,0,,when she introduced herself\Nas the family's daughter-in-law?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:14.21,0:45:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,There was a lobster truck\Nbehind her. Maybe that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:17.50,0:45:20.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Here. Check this out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.42,0:45:23.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone from Jeju ordered our marinated crab.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.05,0:45:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness, my crab will get\Nto visit Jeju before I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.72,0:45:31.71,Default,,0,0,0,,- Lucky you.\N- Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.23,0:45:35.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:35.39,0:45:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,- What's wrong?\N- What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.19,0:45:38.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You look like a famished woman...
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.90,0:45:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,who's disappointed to\Nfind no rice in the cooker.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.36,0:45:47.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Seok-hun has been promoting his apples,
Dialogue: 0,0:45:47.61,0:45:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so how could you upload a\Nvideo of Hae-in eating one?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:49.94,0:45:51.55,Default,,0,0,0,,- Did you?\N- Did I?
Dialogue: 0,0:45:51.58,0:45:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, I'll edit it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:53.29,0:45:55.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Forget it. Over 500,000 people watched it.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.33,0:45:57.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too late now!
Dialogue: 0,0:45:57.25,0:45:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Then let's ask Hae-in to visit again.
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.38,0:46:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,- Yes.\N- She should come.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.44,0:46:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,She can do an eating show with your dad's pears,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.01,0:46:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,and strut down Hong Hae-in's Path.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.20,0:46:06.19,Default,,0,0,0,,What path?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.22,0:46:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,The women's association began a new project.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:08.39,0:46:10.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Since our village has become famous,
Dialogue: 0,0:46:10.22,0:46:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,we'll decorate the entrance\Nand call it "Hong Hae-in's Path."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:14.35,0:46:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's right.\N- We'll get the portrait rights.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:16.69,0:46:19.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Then we'll display a photo of Hyun-woo and her.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.31,0:46:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Also known as "Yongdu-ri Queen's Path."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.11,0:46:24.38,Default,,0,0,0,,"Walk down this path,\Nand your love will come true."
Dialogue: 0,0:46:24.40,0:46:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's add that too.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.82,0:46:31.47,Default,,0,0,0,,- Get out!\N- Goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.49,0:46:33.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Get out and don't visit anytime soon!
Dialogue: 0,0:46:33.54,0:46:35.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:35.45,0:46:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:37.33,0:46:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.71,0:46:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen's Hair Salon{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:54.85,0:46:56.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Too late. He's married.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.64,0:46:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You should've come five years sooner.
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.56,0:47:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Just go away, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:14.45,0:47:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,People here easily say hello if you lock eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.71,0:47:21.70,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a nice culture.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:22.75,0:47:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be happy...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:23.96,0:47:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,that you're popular with all women,
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.26,0:47:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,including the Yongdu-ri principal's daughter.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:29.26,0:47:31.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The principal's daughter?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.59,0:47:34.32,Default,,0,0,0,,So-yeong?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.71,0:47:38.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that her name?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:38.52,0:47:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard she was kind and pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.69,0:47:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:47:43.19,0:47:46.10,Default,,0,0,0,,She was cute and had short hair.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.36,0:47:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:51.15,0:47:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.41,0:47:54.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Is she your first love that Mi-seon mentioned?
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.78,0:47:57.32,Default,,0,0,0,,She wasn't my first love.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.46,0:48:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If your entire family knew her,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:03.71,0:48:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,does that mean you were engaged?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:05.54,0:48:06.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.75,0:48:08.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.51,0:48:10.07,Default,,0,0,0,,We never even had lunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:10.09,0:48:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,We never did anything,\Nso how is she my first love?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:12.80,0:48:15.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to do anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:15.39,0:48:19.37,Default,,0,0,0,,You're happy to watch them from afar.\NYou can't stop thinking about them.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:19.39,0:48:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You take a detour just to see them once more.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:22.23,0:48:26.06,Default,,0,0,0,,If you did those for the first time,\Nthen that's your first love.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:30.99,0:48:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,That was quite specific.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:34.45,0:48:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Speaking from experience?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:36.91,0:48:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You could say that.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:42.33,0:48:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You were happy to see him from afar.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:44.12,0:48:45.77,Default,,0,0,0,,You couldn't stop thinking about him,
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.79,0:48:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and you even took a detour?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.38,0:48:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:48:54.72,0:48:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was he?
Dialogue: 0,0:48:56.64,0:49:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Every girl falls in love with one at least once.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.97,0:49:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A guy on the bus.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:02.48,0:49:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,A guy on the bus?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:04.35,0:49:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you take the bus to school?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.23,0:49:09.06,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.88,0:49:33.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:49:33.17,0:49:36.86,Default,,0,0,0,,The CCTV cameras have been malfunctioning\Nlately, and they're the repairmen.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:36.89,0:49:39.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It'll take about an hour, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.03,0:50:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's all done.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.25,0:50:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Divorce Agreement{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:13.63,0:50:17.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm sure it was tough for you\Ntoo. You stayed around long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:37.65,0:50:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you find it?
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.41,0:50:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:40.91,0:50:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,- Are you sure this is it?\N- I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:45.41,0:50:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It was three years ago.\NMaybe they threw it away.
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.25,0:50:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think so?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.57,0:51:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:45.39,0:51:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they have that much time?
Dialogue: 0,0:51:50.69,0:51:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Those people are doing\Nnothing in front of that fountain.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.06,0:51:55.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just wasting time sunbathing.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:55.86,0:51:59.13,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just feeding the pigeons.
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.15,0:52:02.67,Default,,0,0,0,,They're resting while doing meaningless things.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:02.70,0:52:06.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Exactly. They're wasting\Ntime doing meaningless things.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:06.54,0:52:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Are they bragging about the time they have?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:09.20,0:52:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,How extravagant.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:19.76,0:52:22.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Luck for sale. Buy some luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.80,0:52:26.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Get luck in your own hands. Luck for sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.43,0:52:29.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Buy some luck. Come get your luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:32.60,0:52:35.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Trying to make money off\Nof common four-leaf clovers?
Dialogue: 0,0:52:35.65,0:52:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What a fraud.
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.42,0:52:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,What kind of fool would buy such things?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:05.84,0:53:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you getting one?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:07.80,0:53:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, just for fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:16.56,0:53:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,That's expensive for some leaves.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.77,0:53:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:54.02,0:53:57.47,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a bit stunned right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:53:58.10,0:53:59.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.77,0:54:02.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- My weight...\N- Your weight?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:02.57,0:54:04.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It went up by 6 pounds.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:04.32,0:54:07.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gained 6 pounds since\Nmy hospital visit in Korea.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.70,0:54:09.87,Default,,0,0,0,,- What?\N- Don't you normally lose weight when sick?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.90,0:54:12.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that important right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:12.45,0:54:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you know? No one has ever told\Nyou that you had three months left to live.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.63,0:54:25.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been pretty all my life,\Nso what if I turn ugly?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:25.38,0:54:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll only remember my ugly face.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.09,0:54:30.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't allow that.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:31.47,0:54:33.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Well...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:33.52,0:54:37.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't believe me if I said you're pretty...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:38.27,0:54:40.51,Default,,0,0,0,,no matter your weight, will you?
Dialogue: 0,0:54:41.82,0:54:42.96,Default,,0,0,0,,So...
Dialogue: 0,0:54:42.98,0:54:45.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've gained weight.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:45.94,0:54:48.44,Default,,0,0,0,,- That's not what I meant.\N- Just watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:54:48.86,0:54:52.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be gorgeous until I die.
Dialogue: 0,0:55:01.46,0:55:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:57:56.43,0:57:57.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm hungry.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:25.91,0:58:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,How long were you looking for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:27.83,0:58:29.91,Default,,0,0,0,,For about an hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:31.38,0:58:33.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Time keeps fading away.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:33.88,0:58:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't have much time as it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:37.72,0:58:40.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't remember again?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:41.01,0:58:42.55,Default,,0,0,0,,No, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.97,0:58:46.51,Default,,0,0,0,,- I just saw someone.\N- Who?
Dialogue: 0,0:58:50.31,0:58:52.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}My older brother.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:22.18,0:59:24.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}When I was nine,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:24.31,0:59:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}we went on a boat ride\Nduring our summer vacation.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:27.35,0:59:29.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}We got into a mysterious accident.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:48.66,0:59:50.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- There!\N- Hae-in!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:50.21,0:59:52.35,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Hae-in! Goodness!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:52.38,0:59:55.29,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Gosh, Hae-in!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:55.88,0:59:57.77,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Are you okay?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.80,0:59:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Are you all right?\N- Mom, where is Su-wan?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.80,1:00:02.04,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}He saved me.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:03.01,1:00:04.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Su-wan?{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:05.93,1:00:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}He was just...{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:10.27,1:00:11.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Su-wan!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.85,1:00:13.55,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Su-wan!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:14.15,1:00:15.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Su-wan!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:15.57,1:00:18.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}Please save my boy!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.44,1:00:20.21,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Su-wan!\N- One, two, three, four.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:20.24,1:00:22.73,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF00&}- Five, six, seven, eight, nine...\N- Su-wan!{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:22.86,1:00:24.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}That's how...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.41,1:00:27.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}he died.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.33,1:00:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}After losing her son,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.83,1:00:32.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}my mom couldn't...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:32.92,1:00:35.49,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}eat, sleep, or forgive me...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:35.84,1:00:38.16,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}for a very long time,{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:39.01,1:00:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}and I felt bad...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.55,1:00:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}for Su-wan.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.59,1:00:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}It wasn't your fault.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:52.02,1:00:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I know,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.90,1:00:56.39,Default,,0,0,0,,but I couldn't shake off the guilt,
Dialogue: 0,1:00:57.94,1:01:00.06,Default,,0,0,0,,because it felt like...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.44,1:01:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I stole his life.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:06.99,1:01:08.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard this somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:08.83,1:01:10.93,Default,,0,0,0,,When you're about to die,
Dialogue: 0,1:01:10.95,1:01:13.91,Default,,0,0,0,,the person who loved\Nyou the most picks you up...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:14.25,1:01:16.24,Default,,0,0,0,,in the form of an angel.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:16.79,1:01:18.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Su-wan...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:19.05,1:01:21.33,Default,,0,0,0,,who sacrificed his life for me...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:27.39,1:01:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he came...
Dialogue: 0,1:01:30.06,1:01:32.09,Default,,0,0,0,,because it's time.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.02,1:01:45.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Delirium is one of the many\Nside effects of your injection.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:45.45,1:01:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a hallucination. It's not an angel.
Dialogue: 0,1:01:49.87,1:01:51.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,1:01:52.62,1:01:55.07,Default,,0,0,0,,It's part of the treatment.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:08.18,1:02:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not easy...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:10.43,1:02:12.32,Default,,0,0,0,,to survive an illness,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.35,1:02:14.05,Default,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:15.56,1:02:18.14,Default,,0,0,0,,you must pull through, Hae-in.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:23.11,1:02:24.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:24.86,1:02:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,and I will,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.28,1:02:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,but...
Dialogue: 0,1:02:29.45,1:02:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,let's say a lot of time passed,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.08,1:02:36.07,Default,,0,0,0,,and you died.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.37,1:02:41.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll become an angel and pick you up.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:49.64,1:02:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If I show up,
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.76,1:02:53.05,Default,,0,0,0,,it'll be less scary for you.
Dialogue: 0,1:02:59.10,1:03:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:01.41,1:03:02.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That it'll be less scary?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.52,1:03:06.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course. I'll be the prettiest angel.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.16,1:03:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.87,1:03:20.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.67,1:03:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,You do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.05,1:03:27.75,Default,,0,0,0,,But for now,
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.13,1:03:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,let's dig in.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:37.77,1:03:39.47,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:03:44.15,1:03:45.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's eat up...
Dialogue: 0,1:03:46.44,1:03:48.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,1:03:58.96,1:04:00.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Juseong Tech{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:10.84,1:04:15.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Juseong Tech 24{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.14,1:04:18.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Closed{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.22,1:04:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Data Recovery\NJuseong Tech 24{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.10,1:04:24.37,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}We Have Shut Down for Personal Reasons{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.40,1:04:26.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes. That's perfect.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:28.28,1:04:30.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is northwest.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:30.99,1:04:34.84,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the direction that's in\Ncharge of money, success, and luck.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.87,1:04:37.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It's great that you put up\Nan enterprising painting...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:37.74,1:04:38.76,Default,,0,0,0,,like this here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:38.79,1:04:42.03,Default,,0,0,0,,It finally found its owner.\NIt looks much better here.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:42.87,1:04:45.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You've given me such a huge gift.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:45.50,1:04:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How can I repay you?
Dialogue: 0,1:04:48.67,1:04:49.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no need.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:49.67,1:04:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I only gave it to you out of respect.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:53.05,1:04:54.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.34,1:04:56.61,Default,,0,0,0,,About that resort complex...
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.64,1:05:00.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard a consulting firm is\Nchecking its validity and profitability.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.81,1:05:04.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, my grandson-in-law advised me to do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:04.10,1:05:05.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad. It's good to be sure.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.77,1:05:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm talking to other companies\Ntoo, so don't feel pressured.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:09.48,1:05:14.97,Default,,0,0,0,,What? Other companies? I heard\NChairman Yeom has been busy lately.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.99,1:05:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you speaking with him too?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.49,1:05:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Gosh, I hope Chairman Yeom...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:19.04,1:05:22.43,Default,,0,0,0,,doesn't steal this great opportunity from us.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.46,1:05:24.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That can't happen.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.08,1:05:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,- Sir.\N- What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:29.71,1:05:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How much money did Mr. Song embezzle?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:33.01,1:05:34.28,Default,,0,0,0,,$13 million, sir.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.30,1:05:36.75,Default,,0,0,0,,And no one knew?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:37.01,1:05:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,- This whole time?\N- I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:38.72,1:05:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,He set the workers' wages...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.26,1:05:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,higher than normal, or\Nmanipulated financial statements...
Dialogue: 0,1:05:42.98,1:05:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,based on the certificates of deposit.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:45.27,1:05:47.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Will he keep his mouth shut?
Dialogue: 0,1:05:47.15,1:05:50.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Our attorneys are present while\Nthe prosecution interrogates him.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:50.19,1:05:52.46,Default,,0,0,0,,He won't tell a soul,
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.49,1:05:54.27,Default,,0,0,0,,but here's the problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.53,1:05:59.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It was quite a hefty sum, so\Nthe higher-ups will be involved.
Dialogue: 0,1:05:59.24,1:06:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,They could summon you too,\Nso you should brace yourself,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:02.70,1:06:06.83,Default,,0,0,0,,but of course, our law firm will\Ndo their best to prevent that.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:06.86,1:06:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Beom-jun.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:07.88,1:06:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Father.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:10.00,1:06:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't...
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.71,1:06:13.15,Default,,0,0,0,,about Mr. Song.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.17,1:06:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,They were after me!
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.13,1:06:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Who did it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:17.76,1:06:20.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Who told the prosecution about it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:20.64,1:06:24.17,Default,,0,0,0,,It must've been someone very close to you.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:24.27,1:06:25.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll find them.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:25.27,1:06:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,They'll pay for this.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.15,1:06:32.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:37.61,1:06:39.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:40.78,1:06:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:43.79,1:06:46.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It's an RF transmitter VOX listening device.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:46.25,1:06:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only activated when it hears a\Ncertain level of noise or human voice.
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.13,1:06:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Who was brazen enough to do this?
Dialogue: 0,1:06:53.88,1:06:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Given the size of this device,
Dialogue: 0,1:06:55.76,1:07:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I think we can find a microwave\Nreceiver in a 1-mile radius.
Dialogue: 0,1:07:56.57,1:07:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}We can transfer the\N$30 million to Mr. Jin's account.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:59.07,1:08:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Then sell the stocks under borrowed\Nnames and send them in small chunks.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.36,1:08:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Yes, do that and inform Mr. Jin.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:04.78,1:08:05.80,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hold on.\N{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}- Yes, sir.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:05.83,1:08:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why was this in Hyun-woo's office?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:09.54,1:08:11.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Anything else?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.33,1:08:13.83,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}There was a safe in Mr. Baek's room.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.71,1:08:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Open it.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:25.47,1:08:26.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Why can't I reach you?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:26.76,1:08:29.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you know what happened last night?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:29.10,1:08:32.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Your grandfather's study was bugged.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:32.02,1:08:33.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}He's already on edge...{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:33.44,1:08:35.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}because his financial manager\Nwas accused of embezzlement.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.98,1:08:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,- So?\N- "So"?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:37.53,1:08:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Your husband set up the bug.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.70,1:08:43.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you have proof?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:43.70,1:08:45.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly why I'm calling.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.83,1:08:48.01,Default,,0,0,0,,We found a receiver in his room.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:48.04,1:08:51.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone could've placed it\Nthere while we were gone.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:51.16,1:08:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,The house was empty for days.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:53.75,1:08:54.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you all stupid?
Dialogue: 0,1:08:54.75,1:08:56.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't take his side.
Dialogue: 0,1:08:56.54,1:09:00.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd found it odd that Hyun-woo was\Nso against Soo-cheol's business idea.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:01.01,1:09:05.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Check the CCTV cameras before\Npointing your finger at him.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:06.05,1:09:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mom{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.61,1:09:21.92,Default,,0,0,0,,See? I'm all you have, aren't I?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:21.94,1:09:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Just admit it.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.95,1:09:26.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I'm here.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:26.24,1:09:28.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The store is closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:29.58,1:09:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, for good. They've shut down.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.16,1:09:33.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you give them?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:33.29,1:09:34.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Then look across the street.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.87,1:09:35.89,Default,,0,0,0,,My car is there.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:35.92,1:09:37.19,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Public Parking Lot{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:37.21,1:09:39.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What? You weren't lying.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:39.80,1:09:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did you park here?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:40.96,1:09:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The key is on the front right wheel.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:46.76,1:09:47.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:47.89,1:09:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Send me my dashcam's SD card,
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.10,1:09:54.79,Default,,0,0,0,,and find out when the store closed.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:54.81,1:09:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this a case, with a suspect?
Dialogue: 0,1:09:56.27,1:09:58.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Something like that. Thanks in advance.
Dialogue: 0,1:09:58.61,1:10:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I may be a divorce attorney,
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.03,1:10:03.94,Default,,0,0,0,,but I've always wanted\Nto work on criminal cases.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:05.28,1:10:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:20.96,1:10:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.09,1:10:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,I was on the phone.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:25.01,1:10:26.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What's it about?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.43,1:10:28.46,Default,,0,0,0,,I was calling Yang-gi.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:29.47,1:10:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Did anyone else call you?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:32.51,1:10:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Like who?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:34.39,1:10:37.47,Default,,0,0,0,,My mom or others.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:38.77,1:10:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't pick up any calls from my family.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:41.65,1:10:42.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Why not?
Dialogue: 0,1:10:42.78,1:10:44.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Just don't.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:45.82,1:10:46.99,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mother-in-Law{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:54.66,1:10:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't answer it.
Dialogue: 0,1:10:56.79,1:11:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't be stressed when taking the injections.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:00.75,1:11:02.63,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Power Off{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:13.81,1:11:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,This is Moh Seul-hee.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:15.81,1:11:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Oh Sun-yeong.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.77,1:11:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you mean? It's Seul-hee.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.61,1:11:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,She's Oh Sun-yeong who died 30 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.40,1:11:32.13,Default,,0,0,0,,So this Oh Sun-yeong died 30 years ago,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:32.16,1:11:35.03,Default,,0,0,0,,- and she's actually Moh Seul-hee?\N- Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:36.87,1:11:39.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Then where's the real Moh Seul-hee?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:39.75,1:11:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure. However...
Dialogue: 0,1:11:46.46,1:11:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Sun-yeong was arrested for adultery\Nthree years prior to her death,
Dialogue: 0,1:11:50.18,1:11:53.13,Default,,0,0,0,,and she gave birth behind bars.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:54.60,1:11:56.17,Default,,0,0,0,,She has a child?
Dialogue: 0,1:11:58.39,1:11:59.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,1:11:59.39,1:12:01.81,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Imprisoned when 4 months pregnant\NGave birth to a boy{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:04.86,1:12:07.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, we should wait until Hyun-woo comes.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:07.36,1:12:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Be quiet!
Dialogue: 0,1:12:24.34,1:12:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:25.34,1:12:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,- How dare he?\N- What is it?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:34.79,1:12:36.01,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Divorce Settlement Agreement{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:36.04,1:12:37.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Goodness.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:37.06,1:12:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Signed: Baek Hyun-woo\NHong Hae-in{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:46.94,1:12:48.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Do I need to pray?
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.07,1:12:53.38,Default,,0,0,0,,The therapy results come out tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:53.41,1:12:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I need all the luck I can get.
Dialogue: 0,1:12:59.24,1:13:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why is there a long line?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:02.25,1:13:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Should we check it out?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.12,1:13:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't like to wait in line.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:06.75,1:13:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, I don't do that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.51,1:13:13.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd feel like an ordinary person. I hate that.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:13.05,1:13:14.19,Default,,0,0,0,,But?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.22,1:13:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:15.72,1:13:17.88,Default,,0,0,0,,strangely enough,
Dialogue: 0,1:13:18.68,1:13:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd like to be ordinary for once.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:20.77,1:13:26.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to wait in line and just\Nhope they'll still have a kebab...
Dialogue: 0,1:13:26.23,1:13:28.60,Default,,0,0,0,,left for me.
Dialogue: 0,1:13:31.19,1:13:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you get in line?
Dialogue: 0,1:13:32.95,1:13:34.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:17.91,1:14:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,She needs...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:21.49,1:14:23.57,Default,,0,0,0,,all the luck she can get.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:29.50,1:14:31.73,Default,,0,0,0,,You still can't reach them?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.75,1:14:34.86,Default,,0,0,0,,No, their phones are turned off.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.88,1:14:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,- Gosh.\N- A divorce?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:37.84,1:14:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I looked into him,
Dialogue: 0,1:14:39.80,1:14:42.24,Default,,0,0,0,,and the friend he met the\Nmost often these days...
Dialogue: 0,1:14:42.26,1:14:46.63,Default,,0,0,0,,was Kim Yang-gi, a divorce attorney.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:46.69,1:14:49.21,Default,,0,0,0,,That might not be anything,\Nbut there's a bigger problem.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.23,1:14:51.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's where Mr. Kim works.
Dialogue: 0,1:14:51.40,1:14:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,- It's Apollon.\N- What?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.32,1:14:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't that Chairman Yeom's law firm?
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.07,1:15:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, so I'm worried that\NMr. Baek may have handed over...
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.24,1:15:02.01,Default,,0,0,0,,the bugged files to him.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:02.03,1:15:06.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That must mean Hyun-woo\Nwas the whistleblower, right?
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.87,1:15:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You shouldn't jump to conclusions.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:09.57,1:15:10.56,Default,,0,0,0,,She's right.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.58,1:15:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo doesn't know\Nanything about the secret fund.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:13.96,1:15:16.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear it. Call them.
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.09,1:15:18.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell them to come home right now!
Dialogue: 0,1:16:09.02,1:16:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I found it.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:11.40,1:16:13.22,Default,,0,0,0,,It was still here.
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.46,1:16:34.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you serious?
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.72,1:17:28.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mom{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:35.48,1:17:37.06,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Dad{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:43.28,1:17:44.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Hyun-woo.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:45.95,1:17:47.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I got it.
Dialogue: 0,1:17:57.17,1:18:00.45,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that? What's he holding?
Dialogue: 0,1:18:02.71,1:18:03.69,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Mom\NNew Message{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.21,1:18:41.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hae-in, I found it. On my way here...
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.82,1:19:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}Divorce Settlement Agreement{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:09.07,1:19:11.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me this isn't true.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:11.95,1:19:13.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:14.66,1:19:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Deny it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.42,1:19:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,- Hae-in...\N- Say it.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:20.29,1:19:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me it's not true.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:25.09,1:19:27.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Tell me it wasn't you.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:37.48,1:19:39.01,Default,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:42.73,1:19:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,It was me.
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.99,1:19:57.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I couldn't tell you.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:12.36,1:21:14.57,Default,,0,0,0,,- I'm okay. Take it.\N- Mr. Baek...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.60,1:21:15.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really okay.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:15.66,1:21:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But I...
Dialogue: 0,1:21:27.17,1:21:29.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a driver.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:45.10,1:21:46.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait. Slow down.
Dialogue: 0,1:21:46.52,1:21:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:21:47.94,1:21:49.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Slow down a bit.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:29.23,1:22:34.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}You're happy to watch them from afar.\NYou can't stop thinking about them.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:34.36,1:22:37.17,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}You take a detour just to see them once more.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:37.20,1:22:40.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&H7AA0FF&}If you did those for the first time,\Nthen that's your first love.{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:49.75,1:22:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, please follow that bus.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:52.21,1:22:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,1:22:53.67,1:22:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That bus will cross the bridge.
Dialogue: 0,1:22:55.34,1:22:57.63,Default,,0,0,0,,It's okay. Please follow it.
Dialogue: 0,1:24:21.97,1:24:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}{\c&HFFFF&}Queen of Tears{\c}{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:53.00,1:24:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}You've given up everything?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.46,1:24:59.11,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}What'll you do? Do something if you can!{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:59.13,1:25:01.96,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Stop playing. You disgust me.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:02.38,1:25:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}He bugged your room.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:04.80,1:25:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}But I can look past them.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:06.47,1:25:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}Why would you?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:08.26,1:25:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}She knows about the divorce.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:09.72,1:25:11.41,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}The audit team will do that.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:11.43,1:25:13.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}You'll be kicked out mercilessly.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:13.60,1:25:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}- {\i1}He sent the flowers to a Kim Min-ji.\N- Where is she right now?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:16.65,1:25:18.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}How feisty.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:18.02,1:25:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}What if I replaced him?{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:20.94,1:25:24.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}{\i1}But please keep your\Ndistance from Yoon Eun-sung.{\i0}
